      "id": "tech/lfi-api-hub/trust-framework/api#trust-framework-api#0",
      "document_id": "tech/lfi-api-hub/trust-framework/api",
      "type": "intro",
      "text": "Trust Framework — API\n\nSeveral things that you can do in the Trust Framework portal can also be done via API — managing organisations, software statements, authorisation servers, certificates, and contacts.\n\nThe API uses mTLS for all authenticated requests. A valid transport certificate registered in the Trust Framework is required.",
      "metadata": {
        "title": "Trust Framework — API",
        "source_repo": "community-standards",
        "source_file": "src/pages/tech/lfi-api-hub/trust-framework/api/index.vue",
        "parser": "vue-sfc"
      }
    },
